  "review_scope": "Semantic witness mapping only: public header anchors, actual named C selector/assertion behavior, exact registered AUnit labels, supporting versus direct API attribution and selected unchanged coroutine T obligations. This decision grants no production-runtime or platform-context acceptance.",
