  "resolved_review_findings": [
    "String/table/UTF8 opener presence alone was insufficient; four direct bare-state constructor cases now assert actual function type, stack delta, global absence and module behavior.",
    "T-specific public-call attribution now binds conformance_api.c/.h, conformance_adapter.c and the pinned unchanged coroutine source.",
    "AUnit warning expectation now uses exact actual Short_Source text, preserving all warning bytes and rejecting appended diagnostics."
  ],
