  },
  "verified_boundaries": [
    "Synchronous callk/pcallk does not establish yielded K behavior; distinct suspended/zero/fixed/open/error/nested/non-K child witnesses are required.",
    "lua_getstack/getinfo use valid active hook frames; exported C getinfo is limited to selector l. Inactive-frame rejection is explicitly Ada-only.",
    "lua_isuserdata light-state dispatch and direct T yield require their selected unchanged coroutine runtime blocks; bootstrap supporting cases alone do not establish them.",
    "lua_load and C lua_getlocal/lua_setlocal remain excluded unexercised public exports; Lua inspection does not imply those exports.",
    "to-close return/error/resumed continuation, immediate top-lowering and explicit closeslot have distinct named cases; live result/error identity is asserted.",
    "Resume-refusal recovery uses protected calls only on the healthy parent; failed-child recovery is ordinary stack access.",
    "All author proposal runtime statuses and evidence remain pending; final clean revision, all26 contexts and independent matrix review are separate gates."
